---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title={`About — ${site.name}`}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <p class="strip-label">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold">{site.name}</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-data text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-strip-accent">{site.title}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert mt-10 space-y-6 text-strip-muted">
      <p>
        I'm Bilal Qayyum — a builder and analyst who works at the intersection of data, business requirements, and production systems. I don't just analyse datasets; I ship the platforms that turn analysis into action.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work spans three domains: turning 20 years of government aviation data into interactive BI dashboards, building <a href="https://safarwise.app" class="text-strip-accent hover:underline">SafarWise</a> — an AI-powered visa intelligence platform for Pakistani travelers — and delivering <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kababish.restaurant" class="text-strip-accent hover:underline">Kababish Restaurant</a>, a production Android ordering app with realtime kitchen operations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether the deliverable is a CASE study, a stakeholder process map, or a full-stack product, I focus on clarity: what was the business question, what did the data show, and what should we do next?
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 strip-card">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Experience Highlights</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 font-data text-sm text-strip-muted">
        <li><span class="text-strip-signal">▸</span> Founded & built SafarWise — AI-assisted visa research platform with 300+ published guides (Next.js, FastAPI, Supabase, Gemini AI)</li>
        <li><span class="text-strip-signal">▸</span> Shipped Kababish Restaurant v3.0.4 — Kotlin/Compose Android app with Supabase realtime</li>
        <li><span class="text-strip-signal">▸</span> Pakistan Aviation Analytics — ETL pipeline + BI dashboard over 173K+ CAA traffic records</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
